.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dkp-version 1  "version 0.5.0" 
.SH NAME
dkp\-version \- Bump a pack\*(Aqs manifest.json version (patch/minor/major/etc., npm\-version\-style)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdkp version\fR [\fB\-\-no\-git\-tag\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-same\-version\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-message\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-\-audience\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIBUMP\fR> [\fIPACK\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bump a pack\*(Aqs manifest.json version (patch/minor/major/etc., npm\-version\-style)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-git\-tag\-version\fR
Skip git commit/tag even if the pack is inside a git repository
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR [default: plain]
Output format
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
plain: Human\-readable plain text (default)
.IP \(bu 2
table: Aligned table using comfy\-table
.IP \(bu 2
json: Pretty\-printed JSON
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-same\-version\fR
Allow bumping to the same version as the current one
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress informational output; print only results
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-message\fR \fI<MESSAGE>\fR [default: chore: version %s]
Commit message template; %s is replaced with the new version
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Print debug info (schema paths, provider calls, etc.)
.TP
\fB\-\-audience\fR \fI<ID>\fR
Filter content to assets tagged for a specific audience profile
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIBUMP\fR>
New version: major|minor|patch|premajor|preminor|prepatch|prerelease|<x.y.z>
.TP
[\fIPACK\fR]
Path to the DKP pack directory (defaults to the current directory)
.SH VERSION
v0.5.0
